{"synopsis":"Setelah bereinkarnasi ke dunia fantasi, ia menjadi guru dari Sang Kaisar Wanita sebelum ia beralih ke kegelapan.\n\nMurid kecil yang dulunya sering diperlakukan dengan kejam tiba-tiba menyadari bahwa gurunya kini menjadi lebih lembut, lebih kuat, dan semakin berhati lembut meski ucapannya masih tajam…\n\nSu Changge: “Sialan, sistem, aku tidak mau jadi penjahat brengsek!”\nSistem: “Terlahir sebagai penjahat, takdirnya adalah menjadi antagonis!”\nFeng Wanqing: “Bagaimana jika aku jatuh cinta pada guruku? Aku ingin menjalani kisah cinta manis yang bisa menghancurkan langit dan bumi bersamanya.”","alternative_title":"My Empress Disciple Is About to Turn Dark","author":"九川动漫","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"fbeae560-2e3f-470d-815b-dd9d370ab0b9","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_c81007a9-de9c-4031-8e83-4e834f9380f5/chapter_ch_72/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"bdecdb5e-4ad7-4ffe-b27e-c2d121aec8c1","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17","images":["https